[00:00.00][by:盲跃]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Patrick Stump/Pete Wentz/Andy Hurley/Joe Trohman/Wesley Eisold
[00:10.79]How cruel is the golden rule?
[00:10.79]这黄金法则如此残酷
[00:20.83]When the lives we lived are only golden-plated
[00:20.83]当我们的人生仅仅外表华美
[00:31.24]And I knew that the lights of the city
[00:31.24]我深知这城市的灯火
[00:35.28]were too heavy for me
[00:35.28]对我而言太过沉重
[00:41.94]And though I carry karats for everyone to see
[00:41.94]尽管我在每个人面前衣着光鲜
[00:50.10]
[00:52.74]And I saw God cry in the reflection of my enemies
[00:52.74]我看到上帝在敌人的映像中哭泣
[00:59.28]And all the lovers with no time for me
[00:59.28]没有人愿意抽出时间来爱我
[01:03.78]And all of the mothers raised their babies
[01:03.78]母亲们抚育自己的孩子
[01:09.75]To stay away from me
[01:09.75]只为了远离我
[01:14.07]
[01:17.26]Tongues on the sockets of electric dreams
[01:17.26]人们纷纷议论着美好的梦想
[01:27.53]Where the sewage of youth drown the spark of my tears
[01:27.53]青春的污点湮没在我的泪光中
